The component goes negative on words about keeping things private or restricted. It is
strongest on the Java/C# access modifier "private", weaker on "protected", and weaker still
on "static" (stronger when it follows another modifier, as in "public static"). It is weaker
again on general words about protection, secrecy, and inwardness. Everything else stays near 0.
