"""A token-spelling detector for ti-like syllables and short fragments.

Standalone 'ti' spellings across scripts give a large negative response.
Short ti/ty endings and anti- give smaller responses. Longer whole words
usually do not: matching letters alone is insufficient. The constants are
rounded training averages. No preceding or future tokens are used.
